WEBVTT

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.400
The pixel dust crossed the stylus bridge!

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.500
It is turning every gentle curve into rigid squares!

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:19.990
Stand behind the pleated walls!

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.410
No loose grid will flatten our folded sanctuary.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.760
Squares divide light into pieces, Warden.

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:44.960
Hold your golden creases steady—

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:47.480
I will weave the full spectrum through them.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:59.430
Every crisp fold doubles our strength!

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.730
Strike the center ridge—let the light flow!

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:06.410
True color never breaks into boxes.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:10.850
Watch the continuous spectrum mend every jagged edge!

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.780
They are not breaking anything anymore!

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:26.560
Your rainbow beam taught the pixels how to dance with sunlight!

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:41.070
Paper remembers the warmth of hands, and crystal remembers the shape of light.

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:42.830
Together, nothing fades.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:46.270
Look past the glass horizon—

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:50.610
the Architect opened a silent white gallery stripped of every brushstroke.
